abstract: >-
  Goto — a local-first, end-to-end-encrypted, cross-platform task
  workflow. Three components share one data model: a browser web app
  (Vite + React 18 + Zustand 4 + TypeScript 5, data persisted to
  IndexedDB, vault encrypted with Web Crypto / PBKDF2), an optional
  Python/FastAPI backend, and a self-hostable WebSocket relay that
  only forwards ciphertext frames. Cross-device sync runs over an
  E2EE P2P session (Ed25519 identity, X25519 ECDH, HKDF-SHA256,
  AES-256-GCM, vector-clock conflict resolution). Strict TypeScript
  end to end; 900+ tests.
